      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.617027282714844,
        131.68289184570312,
        72.75702667236328
      ],
      "text": "Treatment duration",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        73.62702941894531,
        399.14276123046875,
        87.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "A review of five RCTs involved children (3 weeks to 16 years) of short- (4–7 days)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        86.62702941894531,
        399.1029052734375,
        100.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "versus long-course (7–14) duration of ceftriaxone for meningitis [Karageorgopoulos,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        99.62702941894531,
        399.1229553222656,
        113.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "2009). No difference was demonstrated between short-course and long-course",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        112.62702941894531,
        399.1429748535156,
        126.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "treatment with intravenous ceftriaxone with regard to end-of-therapy clinical success",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.62702941894531,
        396.7925720214844,
        139.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "(five RCTs, 383 patients, fixed effect model [FEM], OR 1.24, 95% CI 0.73 to 2.11); long-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.6270294189453,
        399.0226135253906,
        152.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "term neurological complications (five RCTs, 367 patients, FEM, OR 0.60, 95% CI 0.29",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.6270294189453,
        399.1127014160156,
        165.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "to 1.27); long-term hearing impairment (four RCTs, 241 patients, FEM, OR 0.59, 95%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.6269989013672,
        399.1126403808594,
        178.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "CI 0.28 to 1.23); total adverse events (two RCTs, 122 patients, FEM, OR 1.29, 95% CI",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.6269989013672,
        399.1427917480469,
        191.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "0.57 to 2.91); or secondary nosocomial infections (two RCTs, 139 patients, random",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.6269989013672,
        399.0630798339844,
        204.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "effects model, OR 0.45, 95% CI 0.05 to 3.71). In two RCTs where hospital stay was not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.6269989013672,
        399.1128845214844,
        217.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "determined by protocol, the duration of hospitalisation was significantly shorter in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.6269989013672,
        399.042724609375,
        230.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "the short-course treatment arms, (137 patients, FEM, WMD 22.17 days, 95% CI 23.85",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.6269989013672,
        96.40290069580078,
        243.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "to 20.50).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        242.6269989013672,
        399.10150146484375,
        256.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "There is low quality evidence that for patients with no adverse prognostic factors",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.6269989013672,
        399.0528564453125,
        269.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "(i.e. delayed presentation, severe illness, persistent CSF culture), short course (4–7 days)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.6269836425781,
        399.13299560546875,
        282.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "is equivalent to long course (7–14 days) ceftriaxone for rates of clinical success and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        296.19268798828125,
        281.406982421875,
        390.8625793457031,
        295.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.16",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.6269836425781,
        395.9967041015625,
        295.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "neurological sequelae, and reduces duration of hospital stay ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        303.12091064453125,
        152.37289428710938,
        315.2608947753906
      ],
      "text": "Antimicrobial resistance",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        316.00091552734375,
        399.13104248046875,
        329.62091064453125
      ],
      "text": "H. influenzae S. pneumoniae  There is a reported, increasing trend in the proportion of  ,",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        329.00091552734375,
        399.081787109375,
        342.62091064453125
      ],
      "text": "N. meningitidis and   showing resistance to penicillin and chloramphenicol [Akpede,",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        342.1308898925781,
        399.03277587890625,
        355.62091064453125
      ],
      "text": "1994; Muhe, 1999; Emele, 2000; Hoban, 2001; Molyneux, 2002; Duke, 2003;Wasfy",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        355.1308898925781,
        399.10272216796875,
        368.62091064453125
      ],
      "text": "2005]. Thus, use of conventional antibiotics may be associated with higher mortality",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        368.1308898925781,
        399.1128234863281,
        381.62091064453125
      ],
      "text": "and morbidity. Penicillin-resistant pneumococcal meningitis has been shown to have",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        381.1308898925781,
        399.1328125,
        394.62091064453125
      ],
      "text": "poor response to treatment with chloramphenicol [Friedland, 1993]. The list below",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        394.1308898925781,
        234.1129150390625,
        407.62091064453125
      ],
      "text": "shows reported chloramphenicol resistance:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        412.8002014160156,
        313.0417175292969,
        426.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "Pneumococcal resistance to chloramphenicol [Hoban, 2001]:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
