      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        601.6427612304688,
        396.8504943847656,
        615.1327514648438
      ],
      "text": "Although there is no difference between cephalosporins and conventional antibi­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        614.6427612304688,
